{
  "slug": "agentmancy",
  "name": "Agentmancy",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI Agent & Skill Builder for Claude Code, OpenCode, and Gemini.\n\nA free alternative to summonaikit that leverages your already existing subscriptions to Claude.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **3 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `analyze` (Use the Task tool to run the agentmancy-repository-analyzer on this repository, write architecture and stack docs to .agentmancy/codebase/,…), `draft` (Draft agents and skills for the user to approve), `suggest` (Propose narrowly scoped subagents and skills for this codebase, then write candidate definitions to .agentmancy/codebase/CANDIDATES.md for the user…)\n- **Agents** (3): `agentmancy-agent-builder` (Build agent .md files from descriptions and write them to agents/ in canonical Claude Code format), `agentmancy-repository-analyzer` (Analyzes repository for structure, tech stack, conventions, hotspots), `agentmancy-skill-builder` (Builds skill .md files from candidate specs and writes them to skills/, reusing registry templates when available)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agentmancy@claude-community` from `vinngo/agentmancy`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 3
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
